  "body": "Hi all,\r\n\r\nPer https://css-tricks.com/html-for-subheadings-and-headings/ and any source I've seen, workarounds for subheadings seem suboptimal.\r\n\r\nAnd so what are your thoughts on the following?\r\n\r\n```\r\n<h1Sub></h1Sub>\r\n<h2Sub></h2Sub>\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\nPersonally I'm unaware of any literature that specifically prevents capitalization's use?\r\n\r\nThanks!",
